WEBVTT

00:01.330 --> 00:04.580
Doom... Doom...

00:05.170 --> 00:08.420
Doom! Doom!

00:06.960 --> 00:09.250
Liese!

00:09.250 --> 00:12.500
S...Sieg!

00:13.170 --> 00:16.710
Please notice these feelings I can't tell you

00:16.710 --> 00:22.880
I'll try to make you see with these skewed and clumsy words

00:23.130 --> 00:26.040
Just for you

00:35.290 --> 00:38.250
I always hide what I mean

00:38.250 --> 00:40.670
(so you don't realize my heart is pounding)

00:40.750 --> 00:45.880
It's all your fault for being far too stunning

00:46.130 --> 00:48.920
No way I can be cute

00:48.920 --> 00:50.670
(I mean, that's not me, is it?)

00:50.670 --> 00:53.500
Even the sky reflected in those eyes

00:53.500 --> 00:56.790
I can't bear to gaze at it straight on

00:56.790 --> 01:02.130
How long am I going to live in this world full of lies?

01:02.130 --> 01:07.080
I'll never manage to change anything at this rate

01:07.250 --> 01:09.790
I don't want that to happen

01:09.790 --> 01:15.920
Even if a god were to speak for me and tell you how I feel

01:15.920 --> 01:21.210
Someday, I want to tell you in my own words that I love you

01:21.460 --> 01:29.960
Even if the words are skewed,
before this precious feeling disappears somewhere

01:30.460 --> 01:33.170
I promise I'll find the courage

01:43.250 --> 01:47.080
<b>The Witch, the Goddess, and the Creation Myth</b>

01:48.670 --> 01:49.460
Liese!

01:51.790 --> 01:54.540
This is the end... Run, everyone...

01:55.040 --> 02:00.210
If I... get possessed by the witch, kill me... Sieg...

02:00.540 --> 02:03.420
Doom... Doom...

02:05.250 --> 02:06.170
Liese...

02:16.790 --> 02:18.290
Lieselotte!

02:23.420 --> 02:24.290
Sieg!

02:24.460 --> 02:25.420
Your Highness!

02:25.880 --> 02:26.710
What?!

02:26.710 --> 02:27.710
Sieg!

02:29.500 --> 02:33.380
Doom... Doom...

02:36.330 --> 02:39.080
Doom... This is the end...

02:39.330 --> 02:41.750
Liese! My dear Liese!

02:42.130 --> 02:46.000
My kindhearted tsun de rais, whom
I love more than anyone else in this world!

02:46.000 --> 02:49.040
Liese! I love you, with all of my heart!

02:51.000 --> 02:55.000
Both the little girl I first met, and who you are right now!

02:59.500 --> 03:02.130
I am all alone.

03:03.880 --> 03:07.630
No one would ever love me.

03:08.710 --> 03:10.330
My dear Liese...!

03:11.330 --> 03:11.830
What?

03:13.080 --> 03:15.580
I love you, with all of my heart!

03:15.960 --> 03:18.960
Liese-tan, it's okay! It's gonna be okay!

03:19.380 --> 03:21.420
I hear... voices?

03:21.920 --> 03:24.750
We're here for you! Everyone's here for you!

03:25.500 --> 03:28.170
We all love you so much, Liese-tan!

03:28.830 --> 03:33.330
Voices... I think I've heard them somewhere before...

03:35.580 --> 03:36.500
Lieselotte!

03:41.790 --> 03:43.040
Lieselotte!

03:45.000 --> 03:46.210
I hear them calling.

03:50.080 --> 03:51.080
Miss Lieselotte!

03:51.210 --> 03:52.170
Lady Lieselotte!

03:52.380 --> 03:53.420
Miss Liese!

03:54.210 --> 03:56.710
They're... calling for me.

03:57.710 --> 03:58.750
Liese!

04:01.330 --> 04:05.330
They're warm. Like the gentle sunshine...

04:08.420 --> 04:10.210
from that lovely spring day...

04:12.670 --> 04:14.000
Lieselotte!

04:21.130 --> 04:22.540
No matter what happens,

04:27.920 --> 04:33.000
I will never let your hand go.

04:41.580 --> 04:45.500
Ever again, Liese. Lieselotte!

04:57.330 --> 05:00.000
Stop. Stop this!

05:00.630 --> 05:02.420
STOP!

05:24.580 --> 05:25.500
Liese!

05:30.380 --> 05:36.290
Sieg, from the very bottom of my heart...

05:38.710 --> 05:41.080
I... love you.

05:50.460 --> 05:52.960
Lieselotte! Thank goodness.

05:53.830 --> 05:55.080
Liese-tan!

05:55.080 --> 05:56.170
Lieselotte!

05:56.330 --> 05:57.960
I'm so glad!

06:04.460 --> 06:06.040
Over there! Something's moving!

06:10.750 --> 06:11.580
What is that?

06:12.000 --> 06:14.290
Is it the Witch of Yore's actual form?

06:28.630 --> 06:29.880
She's all white?

06:29.880 --> 06:32.420
Huh? But the Witch of Yore...

06:32.790 --> 06:34.330
She's supposed to be made of darkness!

06:34.330 --> 06:36.330
Who could this be, then?

06:36.670 --> 06:38.330
What if I give her a good old punch?

06:38.670 --> 06:40.130
Hold on, Fiene!

06:40.130 --> 06:40.750
Huh?

06:41.170 --> 06:42.750
Could that possibly be...?

06:44.540 --> 06:50.130
I was having a horrible nightmare.
I lost sight of who I was, and...

06:50.830 --> 06:53.420
Oh, it was such a terrifying dream.

07:01.250 --> 07:03.080
It... wasn't a dream!

07:03.460 --> 07:06.830
Oh! How could I have done such terrible things?

07:08.130 --> 07:12.250
This here... is the merciful goddess,

07:13.420 --> 07:14.580
Her Holiness Lirenna.

07:15.000 --> 07:16.460
Th-that's right.

07:17.250 --> 07:18.380
What?!

07:18.750 --> 07:19.630
The Goddess Lirenna?!

07:19.960 --> 07:20.880
It can't be.

07:21.330 --> 07:23.630
Artur, are you serious?

07:23.880 --> 07:25.130
The Goddess Lirenna?

07:33.580 --> 07:34.460
What's this?!

07:35.460 --> 07:38.540
Please forgive me, Lady Lieselotte.

07:40.290 --> 07:43.130
Oh, but how could you possibly forgive me?

07:43.460 --> 07:48.420
After... after I did such atrocious things!

07:51.500 --> 07:53.960
Please get your head off the ground, Your Holiness!

07:54.210 --> 07:55.500
What's going on?

07:55.500 --> 07:58.500
The Witch of Yore is the Goddess Lirenna?

07:59.080 --> 08:08.460
I... I linked my heart up with Lady Lieselotte's, in attempt
to make my loneliness and hatred resonate with her.

08:09.000 --> 08:15.330
But it didn't work, because Lady Lieselotte's
emotions came flooding into me instead.

08:15.830 --> 08:18.290
My "emotions"?

08:18.670 --> 08:22.040
That's right. Such as when you felt bliss, or joy...

08:22.500 --> 08:26.170
or "I love Prince Siegwald so much!
He's just as dreamy as ever today!"

08:26.170 --> 08:31.330
"Sieg, I love you. I love you. I love you!
I love you so much!" Stuff like that.

08:31.830 --> 08:34.130
E...enough! Will you just stop?!

08:34.130 --> 08:36.250
Oh, of course! I'm so sorry!

08:36.540 --> 08:39.880
Well, I don't think stopping her
makes much of a difference.

08:39.880 --> 08:42.920
Everyone here knows how Liese-tan feels now, after all.

08:43.210 --> 08:46.920
Lady Lirenna... Would you care
to tell us what happened?

08:47.210 --> 08:50.500
Like, why did she turn into the Witch of Yore?

08:50.830 --> 08:54.500
It's a mystery how Sieg suddenly
started hearing our voices, too.

08:55.460 --> 09:00.040
Allow me to answer you, gods of the other world,
Lady Kobayashi and Lord Endo.

09:00.040 --> 09:00.750
Huh?!

09:01.380 --> 09:02.630
Our voices...

09:02.630 --> 09:03.920
You can hear us?!

09:04.330 --> 09:09.710
Yes. I may be a pitiful fool who has sinned heavily,
but I am a goddess, after all.

09:09.710 --> 09:11.380
Uh, please!

09:11.380 --> 09:12.580
Lady Lirenna.

09:13.040 --> 09:16.170
If you wish to speak, why not lift your face up?

09:16.170 --> 09:19.420
I can hardly hear you properly
when you speak in that position!

09:19.420 --> 09:20.750
Oh, all right.

09:22.000 --> 09:26.380
Then allow me to tell you of all that
has come to pass, from the very beginning.

09:28.250 --> 09:30.790
In the beginning, there was one.

09:35.130 --> 09:40.750
A single entity for the purpose of transforming
and nurturing a world of chaos.

09:42.080 --> 09:47.500
But the one knew itself to be alone,
and we split into two halves.

09:58.290 --> 10:02.080
We became two gods, myself, Lirenna,

10:02.670 --> 10:05.130
and the other, Kuon.

10:17.330 --> 10:24.960
We created this world and brought
many different forms of life into existence.

10:29.290 --> 10:32.750
And finally, we created the first people,

10:33.580 --> 10:35.630
named Adam and Eve.

10:37.710 --> 10:38.830
Wait, "Eve"?!

10:39.880 --> 10:44.000
Adam and Eve loved one other, and gave birth to a child.

10:44.540 --> 10:49.750
But then Kuon had to go and fall in love with Eve.

10:51.080 --> 10:51.960
"Fall in love"?

10:51.960 --> 10:54.250
A god? With a mortal?!

10:54.460 --> 10:55.210
Yes.

11:04.830 --> 11:07.670
I want to make her my own.

11:08.710 --> 11:14.540
Then Kuon went on to kill Eve's husband, Adam.

11:15.170 --> 11:16.880
And what of Kuon?

11:17.250 --> 11:19.630
He sought to make Eve his.

11:20.540 --> 11:24.880
But Eve's affections never turned toward
Kuon for as long as she lived,

11:25.290 --> 11:29.540
nor did she ever love him no matter
how many times she reincarnated.

11:30.830 --> 11:33.500
Then let me become mortal, too.

11:34.420 --> 11:37.540
I will become human, and win her heart for sure this time!

11:38.460 --> 11:41.920
Kuon, but my heart belongs to you. I love you!

11:42.330 --> 11:43.540
You are me, and I am you.

11:43.880 --> 11:50.830
What point is there to be loved by you,
when we are one to begin with?

11:51.170 --> 11:52.080
Kuon!

11:52.080 --> 11:54.210
I want Eve to choose me!

11:57.630 --> 12:01.540
And you think... I'd allow that?!

12:22.380 --> 12:27.250
That impact blasted Kuon off
into another world. As for me...

12:28.830 --> 12:31.000
Don't take my light away.

12:33.920 --> 12:36.130
I loathe that mortal.

12:37.580 --> 12:40.500
I love him. He's mine!

12:41.130 --> 12:42.250
I loathe her.

12:44.130 --> 12:45.420
I won't stand for this.

12:48.080 --> 12:48.960
I won't.

12:50.130 --> 12:51.790
I won't!

12:59.210 --> 13:04.920
And so, I became a force of calamity upon this world.

13:06.920 --> 13:09.380
So uh, basically...

13:09.380 --> 13:14.040
The gods had an infidelity issue
and the world almost got destroyed?

13:15.790 --> 13:16.500
Fiene!

13:16.500 --> 13:18.380
Infidelity issue...

13:18.380 --> 13:19.500
"In...fidelity"?

13:20.210 --> 13:21.750
I'm so very sorry!

13:21.750 --> 13:23.290
Oh, not again!

13:23.750 --> 13:25.080
It's exactly as you say.

13:25.460 --> 13:27.710
My husband Kuon was unfaithful and walked out on me,

13:27.710 --> 13:33.210
so as his wife I got majorly pissed,
threw a hysterical fit, and raged out of control!

13:34.710 --> 13:36.540
So that's the Witch of Yore?

13:36.880 --> 13:40.500
Well, you could say it's satisfying, to find out the truth...

13:40.500 --> 13:42.830
I don't know about "satisfying."

13:43.250 --> 13:46.290
I'm so sorry! So very sorry!

13:46.290 --> 13:48.130
Lady Lirenna! Please!

13:48.290 --> 13:50.880
Lady Lirenna sure is good at groveling.

13:49.040 --> 13:52.000
So very sorry!

13:50.880 --> 13:52.420
Y-yeah...

13:53.960 --> 13:57.290
Lady Lirenna, you said Kuon
got blasted into another world.

13:57.790 --> 14:01.380
Did he get reincarnated in our world as Kirise Kuon?

14:01.790 --> 14:05.790
No, not reincarnated. I believe Kuon possessed him.

14:05.790 --> 14:06.880
"Possessed"?

14:07.170 --> 14:10.170
Yes, it's hazy, but that's what I see.

14:10.420 --> 14:12.170
What do you mean by "what you see"?

14:12.170 --> 14:17.790
Because we were originally one, his eyes are my eyes.

14:18.380 --> 14:19.540
I see.

14:21.290 --> 14:23.790
Wait, if Lady Lirenna can see him...

14:24.000 --> 14:25.710
...doesn't that mean Kuon can see this, too?

14:30.880 --> 14:35.080
Ah, I finally see you! My beloved Eve!

14:35.460 --> 14:38.250
Oh, how beautiful you are!

14:38.750 --> 14:43.040
But Kuon, Eve loves someone else, doesn't she?

14:43.040 --> 14:46.080
Kirise Kuon, don't you interfere.

14:46.670 --> 14:50.250
Don't worry. This time,
I know she will choose me for sure.

14:50.250 --> 14:51.830
She'll love only me.

14:52.330 --> 14:57.250
Just as long as that loathsome woman,
Lirenna, doesn't get in my way!

15:02.880 --> 15:03.880
Lady Lirenna?

15:04.380 --> 15:08.670
It seems Kuon is still obsessed with Eve... with you.

15:08.920 --> 15:10.380
Uh, me?!

15:10.880 --> 15:14.880
Yes. Miss Fiene, you're Eve's reincarnated soul.

15:15.080 --> 15:16.790
Whaaat?!

15:17.130 --> 15:19.330
And you, the burly one next to her.

15:19.960 --> 15:21.000
You're...

15:22.290 --> 15:24.420
the reincarnation of Adam.

15:24.830 --> 15:26.580
Whaaat?!

15:27.330 --> 15:29.000
Fiene is Eve?

15:29.000 --> 15:30.500
And Baldur is Adam?!

15:30.790 --> 15:31.630
Yes.

15:32.080 --> 15:34.540
Huh? But I don't...

15:38.130 --> 15:42.080
Then was that... what Eve remembers?

15:45.420 --> 15:49.210
Ever since our initial encounter,
I've felt this isn't the first time we've met.

15:49.830 --> 15:51.880
So I have Adam's memories, too?

16:01.420 --> 16:04.670
Then it was fate that brought these two together.

16:05.830 --> 16:06.710
Mm-hm!

16:06.880 --> 16:10.000
Come what may, I'll protect you, Fiene.

16:11.290 --> 16:13.500
And I'll protect you, Sir Bal.

16:14.250 --> 16:15.080
Right.

16:16.500 --> 16:19.540
Not to worry. You have all of us by your side.

16:20.830 --> 16:24.500
Wow, this is awesome!
You all care about each other so much!

16:24.500 --> 16:25.580
This is incredible!

16:26.210 --> 16:27.040
Oh, but...

16:27.040 --> 16:28.880
We still have questions, huh?

16:29.420 --> 16:33.960
Lady Lirenna, there's something
called the God Route in Magikoi.

16:34.290 --> 16:41.790
In that ending, Fiene becomes the god Kuon's bride
and gets whisked off to the world where he lives.

16:43.080 --> 16:46.630
That's exactly what Kuon wants, isn't it?

16:47.040 --> 16:48.210
What does that mean?

16:49.040 --> 16:52.830
I imagine after possessing Kirise Kuon's body,

16:53.080 --> 16:57.170
Kuon must have tried to create a link
between that world and this one.

16:57.250 --> 16:59.750
<b>Love Me</b>

16:57.250 --> 16:59.750
<b>Magically!</b>

16:58.330 --> 16:59.500
You know, Kuon.

16:59.920 --> 17:03.500
Don't you think you could listen
to what I have to say a bit more?

17:03.960 --> 17:04.750
What?

17:05.290 --> 17:10.960
You got to make the Magikoi game because I worked
in show business and earned enough money, right?

17:11.420 --> 17:14.670
Silence. My plan was perfect.

17:15.540 --> 17:19.710
I made Magikoi to collect the power from all
the wishes made by the maidens who played it.

17:19.710 --> 17:23.500
And then I would create a link from
this world to connect to Eve!

17:23.790 --> 17:30.830
Kuon plans to take Eve's soul with him
to the other world so that he can make her his.

17:33.460 --> 17:38.210
I was going to find a human in this world
to be the vessel to insert Eve's soul into,

17:38.210 --> 17:41.250
and then she would be mine forever.

17:42.000 --> 17:44.170
But it didn't work out that way, did it?

17:44.630 --> 17:48.080
I succeeded in creating the link,
but had it stolen from me!

17:48.920 --> 17:49.960
They'll pay for this!

17:51.580 --> 17:57.080
You mean our voices are getting heard
over there through that link Kuon created?

17:57.330 --> 17:58.040
Yes.

17:58.290 --> 18:01.380
But why us and not Kuon?

18:01.830 --> 18:04.540
I suppose it's because the bond
between Kuon and Miss Fiene

18:04.540 --> 18:07.500
is far less powerful compared
to you and Lady Lieselotte's...

18:07.500 --> 18:14.250
Or rather, perhaps the two of you have
an analogous relationship to Lady Lieselotte's.

18:14.630 --> 18:16.420
"Analogous relationship"?

18:16.790 --> 18:17.460
Yes.

18:17.710 --> 18:19.210
It's nothing more than speculation,

18:19.380 --> 18:23.960
but for example if each were experiencing
a similarly intense one-sided love?

18:25.040 --> 18:25.920
One-sided...

18:27.330 --> 18:28.040
...love?

18:28.790 --> 18:31.000
Uh no, but there are other possibilities!

18:31.000 --> 18:33.960
Perhaps someone here has
a similar personality to the two of you!

18:33.960 --> 18:36.880
I uh, can't be certain, to tell you the truth!

18:37.250 --> 18:38.710
I'm so very sorry!

18:39.040 --> 18:40.500
Uh, again?!

18:40.830 --> 18:43.500
Well, whatever the case, this is a happy ending, right?

18:43.750 --> 18:45.500
You are all human...

18:46.170 --> 18:50.040
...and you care for each other and trust one another.

18:50.670 --> 18:52.170
And yet here I am,  

18:53.330 --> 18:57.080
bringing so much calamity upon
the world as the Witch of Yore,

18:57.080 --> 19:02.380
trying to possess Lieselotte because of
my loathing for Eve in order to harm Miss Fiene.

19:03.540 --> 19:08.580
I even tried to destroy the very world
I created with my other half.

19:09.830 --> 19:11.880
What I did is unforgivable.

19:12.790 --> 19:14.210
I cannot apologize enough!

19:18.380 --> 19:22.500
Lady Lirenna. I do believe I might understand...

19:23.210 --> 19:25.790
...the painful feelings you endure.

19:27.670 --> 19:32.170
So please, I beg you not to blame yourself any further.

19:35.880 --> 19:37.380
Lady Lieselotte...

19:39.330 --> 19:40.540
Lady Lirenna?!

19:41.500 --> 19:42.130
What's this?

19:42.130 --> 19:43.080
Lady Lirenna...

20:02.330 --> 20:04.080
Lieselotte! Your lirene flower!

20:07.460 --> 20:08.420
Lady Lirenna.

20:10.000 --> 20:12.380
I congratulate you on your full return.

20:13.670 --> 20:14.960
That woman!

20:15.330 --> 20:18.080
Who would have thought
she'd be restored as a goddess?!

20:18.080 --> 20:20.290
Huh? Is that a problem?

20:20.710 --> 20:25.750
She'll use her divine powers
to force me to go back with her.

20:26.580 --> 20:28.710
But I won't let her!

20:30.960 --> 20:34.710
A miracle thanks to Lady Lieselotte's power of love!

20:35.670 --> 20:41.750
Artur, sir. Please have the Church recognize
Lady Lieselotte as a saint and exalt her accordingly.

20:41.750 --> 20:42.460
What?

20:43.210 --> 20:46.130
Whoa, and just like that, she's gonna be a saint!

20:46.130 --> 20:49.420
But Liese-tan's more than worthy of the title!

20:49.670 --> 20:51.130
Congratulations, Liese!

20:51.130 --> 20:52.250
Sieg...

20:52.880 --> 20:54.580
Are you really sure about this, Sieg?

20:55.080 --> 20:55.580
Hmm?

20:55.880 --> 21:01.210
The process for marrying someone officially recognized
as a saint is as troublesome as it gets.

21:02.210 --> 21:08.960
You need approval from over a hundred higher-ups
in the Church and so much paperwork to boot.

21:09.170 --> 21:11.540
Plus definitely more than a dozen rituals.

21:11.540 --> 21:12.420
Uh...?

21:12.750 --> 21:16.460
But you know, there's one way to avoid all that.

21:17.460 --> 21:20.330
Before she gets recognized... just get married!

21:20.500 --> 21:21.170
What?!

21:21.460 --> 21:23.130
M-married?!

21:23.130 --> 21:24.250
Lieselotte!

21:24.380 --> 21:28.670
B-but well, there is a proper order to this kind of thing...

21:28.670 --> 21:32.040
Lady Lieselotte, would you rather
not get married so quickly?

21:32.040 --> 21:33.580
W-well...

21:40.380 --> 21:41.290
Liese.

21:41.880 --> 21:45.710
I realize this might not be the
most elegant way to propose, but...

21:43.670 --> 21:49.670
Your smile is so stunning it almost hurts

21:48.830 --> 21:51.960
Lieselotte, won't you please...

21:49.670 --> 21:55.380
Even now, I can't look at it straight on

21:55.830 --> 22:01.960
The feelings scattered in the depths of my heart

21:57.250 --> 21:58.290
Lady Lirenna!

21:58.290 --> 21:59.040
Huh?

21:59.330 --> 22:01.000
Oh. Sorry, so sorry!

22:01.000 --> 22:02.290
I was just so happy!

22:01.960 --> 22:07.630
It's as if I'm gathering them bit by bit

22:02.290 --> 22:03.580
Read the room!

22:03.580 --> 22:06.790
Kobayashi. I mean, I don't blame you.

22:08.580 --> 22:14.330
Do the stars in the night sky

22:08.790 --> 22:10.080
Won't you please...

22:12.000 --> 22:13.830
agree to marry me?

22:15.330 --> 22:20.380
...see everything? ...know everything?

22:15.710 --> 22:16.500
Yes!

22:17.540 --> 22:19.830
Sieg takes out a ring!

22:20.040 --> 22:23.750
He must have been carrying it around
so he could propose at any moment!

22:21.460 --> 22:27.000
I open the window and ask of them

22:26.790 --> 22:27.710
Oh...

22:27.630 --> 22:31.000
Why?

22:29.040 --> 22:30.540
Lieselotte, congratulations!

22:30.790 --> 22:31.830
Congratulations!

22:32.790 --> 22:39.000
This world is filled with glimmering light

22:39.130 --> 22:45.130
It was your smile that taught me so

22:45.130 --> 22:51.130
I can't help but wish for a happy ending

22:51.500 --> 23:01.290
If only I can stay by your side

23:01.290 --> 23:03.130
Forevermore

23:07.500 --> 23:09.460
Forevermore

23:13.830 --> 23:14.920
Yay!

23:15.170 --> 23:20.960
Yes, yes, yesss! Sieg proposed! And Liese-tan said yes!

23:20.960 --> 23:23.080
Finally! They did it!

23:23.750 --> 23:28.170
I bet soon, we'll reach the best happy end
to end all happy ends, right?!

23:28.960 --> 23:29.540
Huh?

23:30.420 --> 23:32.670
Sorry, I forgot my keys!

23:33.040 --> 23:37.330
Jeez, Sis. I'll come open the door. Hold on.

23:37.330 --> 23:38.000
Hmm?

23:39.500 --> 23:40.210
Huh?

23:42.420 --> 23:43.250
Sis?

23:51.750 --> 23:52.630
Sis?!

23:54.960 --> 23:56.420
No way. What?

23:56.500 --> 23:57.580
You're kidding!

23:57.580 --> 23:58.960
Did she just get kidnapped?!

24:00.040 --> 24:01.420
We need to contact the police, now!

24:04.710 --> 24:07.210
Oh, come on. Now what?!

24:14.330 --> 24:15.500
Sis?!

24:15.790 --> 24:19.080
Now it's my turn. I want to go and help Lady Kobayashee.

24:20.630 --> 24:21.330
Next Episode:

24:21.750 --> 24:23.000
The Best Happy End...

24:23.210 --> 24:25.580
...to End All Happy Ends!

24:24.960 --> 24:27.960
<b>The Best Happy End to End All Happy Ends!</b>
